# Settings > Updates > Packages (report 047 P4, "is it frozen?"): the other waits. Esc on the working box of the first scan
# cancels it (its programs killed, no half result) and goes back to Updates; entering Packages again scans again. The
# refresh of the lists: "Starting the helper..." with the moving bar until the helper's first status, then apt's text, the
# percent bar and the elapsed counter (00:23). The release check on the Updates page: its elapsed counter. A board that is
# not slow: no reassurance line before 20 s. Keys only. Review only: no golden.
title updates wait more
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800 480x320
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_APPS missing
env HARNESS_SUDO ok
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-01
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.9.2 release arm64
update answer pending
apt board pending
apt lists-age 9
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 3000
# the release check still running: its elapsed counter in the status line
expect_text "Checking for updates...  00:03"
shot wait_release_check
update answer releases-real.json
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 2000
# the first scan's box on a board that is not slow: no reassurance line yet; Esc cancels it
shot wait_scan_fast
expect_text "Preparing the updates"
expect_text "Esc cancels"
expect_unclipped "Preparing the updates" "Reading the package lists" "Esc cancels"
key ESC
wait 600
shot wait_scan_cancelled
expect_text "Check now"
# entering Packages again: a new scan (the board answers now)
apt board pi4b
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 3000
shot wait_scan_again
expect_text "Refresh lists"
expect_text "Upgrade 15 packages"
# the highlight on the first row (the list replaced the box: not the last row)
expect_unclipped "Refresh lists" "Upgrade 15 packages"
# the refresh: the helper's unit started, no status yet: "Starting the helper..." and the moving bar
key ENTER
wait 2000
shot wait_refresh_start
expect_text start "Starting the helper..."
expect_text "Refresh lists"
apt refresh state running
apt refresh started now-0
apt refresh percent 37
apt refresh text Retrieving file 2 of 4
wait 19000
expect_text "Retrieving file 2 of 4  00:23"
shot wait_refresh
expect_unclipped "Refresh lists"
apt refresh state done
apt refresh percent 100
apt lists-age 0
wait 3000
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
